    "created_at": "2020-08-25T00:46:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-25T00:46:58Z",
    "body": "There are a few differences between microdata and RDFa, mainly:\r\n\r\n  * Microdata isn't oficially part of the semantic web.\r\n  * RDFa is better for combining vocabularies.\r\n  * RDFa is better for providing multilingual content.\r\n  * RDFa supports typed properties.\r\n\r\nSee: http://manu.sporny.org/2011/uber-comparison-rdfa-md-uf/",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
